WEBVTT

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.760
Did the Jinx do all this?

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.980
Yeah, it was all over in a split-second.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.370
One cannon blast and the Thanatos was gone.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.570
And our homes with it.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:32.210
Is it going to carry on like this?

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:39.800
Well, as long as they keep killing those Thanatos, I ain't complaining.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.480
The Jinx, huh?

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:26.040
Phase 09: A Day Off in Wodon

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:43.610
Oh, taking a break from your research?

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:45.090
Yeah.

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:48.400
It's quiet without her.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.020
She looked really happy when she left.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.710
Want some, Lein?

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.450
I put my best into making them for Angie's friends.

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:00.580
Sure. They look good.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:08.950
I hope you have a good time, Mademoiselle.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:21.250
Welcome home, Angie!

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.980
I missed you, Angie!

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.260
Thank you for your invitation.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.170
Here.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:29.670
Wow, these smell good!

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:32.500
Okay, we're going to spend lots of time together today!

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.760
There are all kinds of things I want to talk about!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.260
Okay!

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:39.930
Hey, these are delicious.

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:45.240
Wow, Angie, they really make cookies this good for you every day?

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:48.340
Yeah, everyone's good at cooking here.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.580
That's not fair.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.890
I already envy you for being surrounded by all those hunky Orb Hunters!

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.820
But you get yummy home-cooked meals as well?

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.820
I'm so jealous!

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:03.610
But I'm sure all this good fortune leads to some difficult situations.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.760
Yeah.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:08.930
Each of them has their good points, but they're all admirable gentlemen!

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:12.780
Even Miss Serious here will find herself falling for one of them, whether she likes it or not.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:13.940
So...

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.200
Which one are you after?

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:24.480
All's right with the world.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:25.580
Too right.

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:28.120
Jeez, both of you.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:34.110
Sorry. We figured you'd had enough time to fall in love by now.

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:35.760
That's not...

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:39.530
But I'm sure you've got less of a load on your shoulders now.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.250
Since the Foundation made those Jinx, I mean.

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:44.200
Jinx...

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.490
Listen, both of you.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.510
The Jinx...

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:04.430
I had no idea.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:09.840
The Jinx may put everyone in danger.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:14.330
But, in the end, there were no victims,

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:17.670
so don't you think we should cut them some slack?

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:18.760
Hannah.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.110
You're over-thinking things.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.970
The Foundation probably just didn't notice.

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:25.180
No!

00:05:25.230 --> 00:05:26.770
I saw it myself!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.470
Right, right... don't look so scared.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:32.390
Oh, I know!

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:35.380
I found this fabulous boutique, do you want to-

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.800
Listen to me!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.750
You two only say that because you don't know how it really is!

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.370
We don't know how it really is?!

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.820
Aren't you talking about yourself there?

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.260
Sally?

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:54.550
You have your special powers and the Orb Hunters are always looking out for you.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:59.730
But what do we do if we're attacked by Thanatos?

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.520
Is it so wrong to rely on the Jinx?

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:03.770
Sally...

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:11.470
Angie, please understand.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.890
If a Thanatos appears, there's nothing we can do.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:19.340
We're not like you.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.080
That's right.

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:25.600
Angie!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.520
Why can't you understand that?!

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:35.000
I only tried to tell them the truth!

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:42.640
Hey, is there anyone round here who can make me some dough?

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.050
There she is.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.690
Hello, my treasure!

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:58.910
It must be fate that we've come across each other here.

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:03.150
Maybe we're destined for one another?

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:06.480
Um... I'm really not in the mood for an interview...

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.740
Oh, your eyes are all red.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.110
Did you get into a fight with your boyfriend?

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:20.230
Then, I'll cheer you up.

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:21.520
I'm sorry.

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:23.720
Leave me alone.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.260
No deal.

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:31.340
I can't leave a crying girl alone.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:39.890
Um...

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.380
Don't worry!

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.210
I picked it out myself.

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.910
You're gonna look great.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:46.870
But...

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:54.620
Looking good.

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.270
When you've got a good figure, you look good in anything.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:07:59.530
I don't have...

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.750
Now then...

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:06.430
When you imagine a secret celebrity date, you imagine...

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:18.610
This is your first time in downtown Wodon?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:24.490
Yes. Before I arrived at the Sunlit Mansion, I almost never left the Academy...

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:25.760
Stop right there!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:30.430
That kind of eloquence isn't suited for a place like this.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.390
But...

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:37.080
Are you sure? If anyone discovers that you're the Queen's Egg, there'll be a huge commotion.

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:44.540
So yeah, try to talk a bit more casually.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:48.480
It's Rosh!

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:49.510
Hey, Rosh!

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:51.390
Take my photo!

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.530
No.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.750
I've told you before: I only take photos to make money.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:56.970
Stingy!

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:57.940
Stingy!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.700
Oh, a new girlfriend?

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.800
A totally different type to the last one.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:09.330
Don't say things like that! I'm still seducing her.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:12.150
Hey, Miss, let me give you some advice:

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:14.490
If you're going to date anyone, date me instead.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:19.550
I'm telling your wife you said that.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.820
Anything but that!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:25.040
You know all the shop owners?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:26.110
Yeah.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.580
This place is my backyard.

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:37.720
Rosh is mine!

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:42.220
Even little girls...

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.880
No way, seriously.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:28.870
Well?

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:32.800
Bet that was a pretty thrilling experience for a princess like you.

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:35.180
You must've figured it out by now...

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.560
I'm not actually a princess.

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:42.990
True. You blended in quite well; surprisingly enough, you could probably live in this town untroubled.

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:44.330
Yeah...

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:46.950
I'm me.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:49.490
I'm nobody special.

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:54.490
I'll tell everyone at the Sunlit Mansion about today.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:59.670
I'll tell them there are people who aren't frightened of the Thanatos - people who are bravely living their lives.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.940
What are you talking about?

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.150
I'll show you something.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.160
Hey, Rosh!

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:23.510
This city's been subject to many Thanatos attacks.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:36.210
It's so crowded here. There's nowhere to run, so the damage is worse than in other places.

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:43.490
You remember them, right?

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:45.130
They're all orphans.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:46.350
Orphans.

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:50.190
Their parents died at the hands of the Thanatos.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:51.730
How awful...

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:54.340
"But they're so bright and cheerful?" you'll say.

00:11:56.680 --> 00:12:02.260
They've lost their parents. If they didn't put on a cheery face, they wouldn't be able to go on.

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:08.270
And those older men and women you talked to - they've also lost family and friends.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:11.390
It's not all that rare here.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.500
This is...

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:20.810
Yeah, the Jinx.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.120
The Jinx?

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.930
They won't be able to survive in these conditions.

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.900
They'll have to rely on friends and relatives to find somewhere else to live.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:49.440
How awful...

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:51.910
Not really.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:55.730
They're still alive, after all.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:02.060
Everybody here is doing their best just to make it through each day,

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:07.790
but as long as we're alive we can rebuild our town, even if the Jinx destroys it.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:11.630
But if a Thanatos gets us, that's it.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:18.650
Then again, if the Queen's Egg saves us when the Thanatos appear, that's a different matter altogether.

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:25.130
But what do we do if we're attacked by Thanatos?

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:27.730
Is it so wrong to rely on the Jinx?

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:31.500
Sally's right.

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:34.500
I had no idea what was really going on.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:39.400
Well, people can only make judgments based on their own experiences.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.900
I don't know about the world you live in.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:52.580
But, in the end, all you can do is live your own way.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:53.930
Me in my own way,

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.340
and you in yours.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.150
Rosh...

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:05.840
Did I say something cool?

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:08.070
Am I glittering with coolness or what?

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.990
You've wrecked it!

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.140
Don't be stupid!

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.030
You're the ones who destroyed my store!

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:28.980
This pittance isn't enough to rebuild!

00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:34.850
Nobody's telling you to rebuild.

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:38.340
This is quite enough for you to rent a new place.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.920
What?

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.600
Don't be so greedy.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:47.070
I know you're trying to fish for more money, but we ain't buying it.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:50.730
I can't believe they'd suggest such a thing!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:51.900
Wait.

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:54.330
What are you planning on doing out there?

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.590
I'm going to protest.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:59.260
That's why you don't know anything.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:00.520
But...

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:01.550
Watch.

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:04.030
I'll show you how I do things.

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:09.250
Wait!

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.280
Just a little more...

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:14.080
Just a little more and I can start over again in a small shop!

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:15.860
You're annoying!

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:22.570
Oh man, what a scoop!

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:30.210
Think we'll call this one "Foundation Members Deliver Final Blow to Penniless Victim."

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.510
Shut up!

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:33.230
Who the hell are you?

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:38.650
What are you doing?

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.760
Man, it hurts just thinking about...

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:46.480
what's going to happen to you when this hits the front page.

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:50.770
So, how much are you willing to cough up?

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.030
Wow, that's a fortune.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:07.580
It must be great being such a huge company.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:11.710
Thanks!

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:16.160
Scum.

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:18.580
I'll take that as praise.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.220
You okay, Mister?

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:26.210
Yeah... shop's a mess, though.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.330
Can't have you closing up shop.

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:35.870
It doesn't feel like the day's begun until I drink one of your espressos.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:39.510
You can say that once you've paid off your tab.

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:42.550
Come to think of it, I did have a pretty hefty one.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.530
Jeez...

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.560
This is a good chance.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.200
That should pay it off.

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:57.410
You don't look satisfied.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:58.880
That's not true...

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.310
I see.

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:09.600
Your method is being a goody two-shoes.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:14.710
I think it's wrong to blackmail people.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.090
But...

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:19.150
you can help people like that.

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:22.480
I had the wrong idea about you.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.910
Are you in love with me?

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.320
No!

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:28.020
Well, you will be one day.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.010
Sure, sure.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:38.860
Um...

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:40.860
Thanks for today.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.040
You've helped me out a lot.

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:46.090
Not really... that wasn't what I was after.

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:51.610
I'm still not very confident, but I'm going to follow the path I believe in.

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:54.870
And what path might that be?

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:57.570
I'll become the Queen as soon as I can.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:01.240
If I do, people won't have to be afraid of Thanatos attacks...

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:04.500
or have their treasured possessions destroyed by the Jinx.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:11.040
Angie!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.080
Angie!

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:25.750
See you.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.670
Angie...

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:39.240
Angie!

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:43.250
We looked everywhere for you.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.000
I'm sorry.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:05.980
Angelique...?

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.790
Hey, what about the Queen's Egg?

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:12.330
What have you come to sell me today?

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.240
Nothing special.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:17.050
Anyway, what about the Queen's Egg?

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:21.490
Yeah... I learned this back when I was researching the Orb Hunters:

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.820
looks like she's an orphan.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.270
An orphan?

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.790
Are you sure?

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:30.340
It's from a reliable source.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:31.940
I see.

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:35.640
I thought she was just some posh, pampered girl.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:37.650
But she's actually just the same as me.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:41.480
Your expression tells me something's bothering you.

00:19:42.050 --> 00:19:43.480
Bothering me...

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:45.660
True, I guess.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.620
So that's what it feels like...

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:52.530
What?

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:54.220
So, you are here to sell.

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.450
What's on the film?

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:57.410
No,

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.990
this is something else.

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:02.060
Just thought I'd drop in and say hi.

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:04.570
See you.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.170
These are from yesterday...

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:14.520
Yes, they were in the mailbox.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:15.800
When did...

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:18.380
How did he take those?

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:25.340
It'd appear he has no intention of using Angelique for money.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:30.420
Does that mean he's supporting me?

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:34.550
All of these pictures are pretty charming.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:37.070
Especially this one.

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:39.170
Oh brother...

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.820
Aren't you letting your guard down a little too easily?

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:04.800
I never take pictures that don't make me money, but before I knew it, I was taking photos of a shop.

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:08.180
How long has it been since I've taken a picture that I can't sell?

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:12.060
Man...

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:14.520
this isn't like me.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:25.700
The Silver Tree is restless.

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:29.150
You can hear it, can't you, Rune?

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:31.480
The elders said...

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:33.990
the time is ripe.

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:34.990
For me.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.190
I see.

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:40.410
One of these days, I'm going to show up that slimy Nyx for what he really is!

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:41.620
Rosh, behind you!

00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:43.570
Next time: Time's Rondo.

00:23:43.780 --> 00:23:46.670
I cannot condone talking behind people's backs, Monsieur.

00:23:46.890 --> 00:23:49.240
Let's just put the whip away, okay?
